    {
      "text": "A photograph on the cover, showing a close-up of a person's hand touching a tablet computer screen that displays a mobile data-collection form headed \"VISIT STATUS\" with selectable options including Treated, Referred, Not Treated and Admitted; in the foreground, paper patient log books with handwritten entries are visible on the desk.",
